    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER THE NINJA</h2><br>Flash of the Blade X is a first-person slasher set in Feudal Japan. <br>Take control of a ninja on a quest for revenge against the clan that betrayed him and left him for dead.<br>Use period-accurate weaponry such as the Katana, Kusari-Gama, and Shuriken to bring death upon enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778600/extras/1c50a380061e21f884e5dd0595375015.poster.avif?t=1743501634\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778600/extras/1c50a380061e21f884e5dd0595375015.webm?t=1743501634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778600/extras/1c50a380061e21f884e5dd0595375015.mp4?t=1743501634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key inspirations for the project include Sho Kosugi movies such as Revenge of the Ninja, the Shinobi games, Wolfenstein 3D, and speed-running platformers.<br><br>Originally released as &quot;Flash of the Blade&quot;, Flash of the Blade X has undergone a ground-up remake, with new levels, new art, better balancing and and an all-around thick coat of polish. The initial one-hit-kill mechanic has been removed in the interest of a deeper experience, and making the game more accessible.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER THE NINJA</h2><br>Flash of the Blade X is a first-person slasher set in Feudal Japan. <br>Take control of a ninja on a quest for revenge against the clan that betrayed him and left him for dead.<br>Use period-accurate weaponry such as the Katana, Kusari-Gama, and Shuriken to bring death upon enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778600/extras/1c50a380061e21f884e5dd0595375015.poster.avif?t=1743501634\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778600/extras/1c50a380061e21f884e5dd0595375015.webm?t=1743501634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778600/extras/1c50a380061e21f884e5dd0595375015.mp4?t=1743501634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key inspirations for the project include Sho Kosugi movies such as Revenge of the Ninja, the Shinobi games, Wolfenstein 3D, and speed-running platformers.<br><br>Originally released as &quot;Flash of the Blade&quot;, Flash of the Blade X has undergone a ground-up remake, with new levels, new art, better balancing and and an all-around thick coat of polish. The initial one-hit-kill mechanic has been removed in the interest of a deeper experience, and making the game more accessible.",
    "short_description": "Flash of the Blade X is a retro-inspired first-person Ninja slasher inspired by the Western Ninja boom of the 1980's. Slice and Dice your way to revenge against your former Ninja clan across several hand-crafted levels using an assortment of period-accurate weaponry.",
